# AGIB Environment Variables

## Groww Trading API (Primary market data)
```bash
# Option A: Daily access token from Groww dashboard (Trading APIs → Generate → Access Token)
GROWW_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_token_here

# Option B: API Key + Secret (checksum flow — requires daily approval)
GROWW_API_KEY=your_api_key
GROWW_API_SECRET=your_api_secret

# Optional override
GROWW_API_BASE=https://api.groww.in/v1
```

# Optional: enable Groww historical candles (3 API calls per refresh — can hit rate limits)
# GROWW_USE_HISTORICAL=true

## NewsAPI.org (server-side only — never prefix with VITE_)
# Requires a NewsAPI plan licensed for public production use.
NEWSAPI_KEY=your_newsapi_key_here

## Optional Google Gemini narrative layer (server-side only — preferred when set)
# Used for market / macro / pre-market briefing enrichment. Falls back to OpenAI.
# Never prefix with VITE_. Add the same key on Render for finance-news-backend
# and agib-intelligence-engine.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_google_gemini_api_key
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest

## Editorial Intelligence Layer (Ask AGI writer only — never analyses)
# AGIB remains the brain. Gemini only rewrites structured intelligence JSON.
# EDITORIAL_LAYER=true
# ASK_AGI_EDITORIAL_LAYER=true
# EDITORIAL_PROVIDER=gemini

## Optional OpenAI Market News narrative layer (server-side only)
# The Market News briefing falls back to deterministic AGI summaries when unset.
# Cached once per 10 minutes; never called per visitor.
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_server_only_openai_key
OPENAI_MARKET_BRIEFING_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini

## Macro Intelligence data sources (server-side only — never prefix with VITE_)
ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY=your_alphavantage_key
FRED_API_KEY=your_fred_api_key
FINNHUB_API_KEY=your_finnhub_key
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=your_twelvedata_key
POLYGON_API_KEY=your_polygon_key
FMP_API_KEY=your_financialmodelingprep_key
# Optional when RBI / ExchangeRate authenticated endpoints are enabled
RBI_DATA_API_KEY=
EXCHANGERATE_API_KEY=

## Yahoo Finance Institutional Provider (YFP V1 — secondary MarketData adapter)
# No API key required. Secondary priority after IndianAPI / Finnhub / FMP.
YAHOO_PROVIDER=true
YAHOO_PROFILE=true
YAHOO_FINANCIALS=true
YAHOO_EARNINGS=true
YAHOO_VALUATION=true
YAHOO_OWNERSHIP=true
YAHOO_OPTIONS=true
YAHOO_FINANCIAL_HISTORY=true
YAHOO_VALUATION_HISTORY=true
YAHOO_CID_ENRICHMENT=true

## Nifty 500 public research (server/worker only — never prefix with VITE_)
# Supabase project URL and a service-role key used only by the backend and
# scheduled Python research worker. Do not expose this key to the browser.
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_server_only_service_role_key

# Comma-separated IST schedule for the Nifty 500 research worker.
# Default: 16:15 (after market close). Optional: 08:30,12:30,16:15
NIFTY500_SCHEDULE_TIMES_IST=16:15
NIFTY500_CONSTITUENTS_PATH=./Nifty500.csv
# Do not replace the current public dataset with a materially incomplete run.
NIFTY500_MINIMUM_PUBLISH_COVERAGE=0.95

## AGI Intelligence Engine (Python FastAPI — server-side only)
# Node proxies /api/intelligence/* to this service. Frontend never calls it directly.
INTELLIGENCE_ENGINE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8100
INTELLIGENCE_ENGINE_TOKEN=dev-intelligence-token
# Optional: disable CIO morning scheduler
# CIO_MORNING_SCHEDULER=false
# CIO_MORNING_INTERVAL_MS=1800000

# FAA search + enrichment (set on intelligence-engine / Render — never VITE_)
# Same keys power Cursor MCP plugins in .cursor/mcp.json
# EXA_API_KEY=
# FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=
# BROWSERBASE_API_KEY=
# BROWSERBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# TAVILY_API_KEY=

# Cursor MCP only (dev tooling — not required for production Ask AGI)
# CONTEXT7_API_KEY=
# RENDER_API_KEY=                 # https://dashboard.render.com/u/settings#api-keys
# PINECONE_API_KEY=               # optional — AGIB prefers Supabase pgvector


## Frontend auth (Vite — required for Hostinger /login)
# These are public client keys. Never put the service-role key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key
VITE_API_URL=https://finance-news-backend-19i5.onrender.com

## Branded auth emails (Node /api/auth/send-verification — server-side only)
# Prefer Supabase custom SMTP + templates (see docs/AUTH_EMAIL_SETUP.md).
# Optional Node send path uses service role + SendGrid or Resend.
FROM_EMAIL=Agarwal Global Investments <support@agarwalglobalinvestments.com>
# SENDGRID_API_KEY=your_sendgrid_key
RESEND_API_KEY=your_resend_key
PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://agarwalglobalinvestments.com

## Newsletter / new-article emails (Node /api/newsletter/* — server-side only)
# Same Resend account as auth; different From address.
NEWSLETTER_FROM_EMAIL=AGI Updates <updates@agarwalglobalinvestments.com>
# See docs/NEWSLETTER_RESEND_SETUP.md

## Existing variables
See server/index.js and src/lib/supabaseClient.js for INDIANAPI_KEY, PERPLEXITY_KEY, SUPABASE_*, etc.
